# ============================================================
# Final board Assigned Physician search combo for Lab/Radiology (Apr 2026)
# - Adds Assigned Physician backend filter to Lab and Radiology boards
# - Renders a searchable combobox with an arrow button (search + list)
# - Preserves physician filter in pagination / export links
