# Requested final-only changes on the latest tablet/full-width build:
# 1) MRD Downtime Addendum / Re-entry Checklist defaults OFF in Control Panel
#    when no saved setting or server environment override exists.
# 2) Remove the Clinical Orders sticky bottom action bar added by the iPad
