    _AI27I_KNOWN_WORDS = set(('a able about above acute advised after again age airway alert allergy ambulance and antibiotic antibiotics assessment associated asthma at back based be before blood breath breathing by care cardiac chest chief clinic clinical clinically complaint complaints condition confirmed consciousness consistent consultant cough course current decreased department diagnosis discharge documented during dyspnea ed emergency evidence exam examination fever final findings follow follow-up for from given good hospital imaging improved in infection information initial intervention interventions investigation investigations is issue issues lab laboratory lower medication medications medicine mild moderate negative no normal not note notes of on or outcome pain patient pending physician plan positive prescribed prescription pressure procedure procedures progress radiology referral reported required result results review risk shortness stable status symptoms system systems team temperature therapy to treatment triage unclear up upper urinary vital vitals vomiting was were with without wound nurse nursing doctor responsible disposition reconciliation return precautions home admitted admission transfer lama pending responsibility complications issues physical review systems abdominal headache dizziness nausea diarrhea constipation cough wheeze wheezing palpitations syncope weakness numbness hypertension diabetes mellitus acute coronary syndrome pulmonary embolism road traffic accident urinary tract infection ECG COPD oxygen saline aspirin morphine ondansetron nitroglycerin paracetamol ibuprofen amoxicillin omeprazole inhaler nebulizer oral intravenous intramuscular PO IV IM PRN q8h q12h daily once twice three times').split())
