# ROOTFIX_20260604L_CLINICAL_ORDERS_MED_SNAPSHOT_CARD_STYLE
# Display-only UI repair for Clinical Orders real-time snapshot:
# - Render Medications using the same compact card/source-header style as
#   Labs and Radiology.
# - Preserve the existing read-only medication snapshot helper.
# - Does not change medication save workflow, Lab/Radiology workflows,
