            ("Scan barcode / enter Case No / MRN / ID number / phone", "Scan barcode / enter Case No / MRN / Cerner MRN / ID number / phone"),
            ("Click patient name / visit / MRN / ID", "Click patient name / visit / MRN / Cerner MRN / ID"),
