# Scope locked to the 11 requested items only:
#   1) Do not touch Case Number / Visit ID generation or values.
#   2) Previous Clinical Orders must not appear in Documentation tab.
#   3) Previous Clinical Orders remains visible only inside Orders / Order Cart & Status.
#   4) Fix Medications vs Previous Clinical Orders overlap in its original Orders location.
#   5) Refresh current vitals remains active after Sign / Assign and updates only the vitals section.
#   6) ED Physician Note Addenda are rendered as the Auto ED Course Summary table format.
#   7) Other Clinical Notes Addenda use the same table format.
#   8) Handoff-to autocomplete resolves from Physicians Directory by name or GD number.
#   9) Auto Handoff Snapshot shows Handoff to: Dr. Name - GD: Number when present.
#  10) Handoff from displays Dr. Name - GD: Number instead of raw number.
#  11) Nursing Notes are printed as a formatted timeline in ED Physician, Auto Course,
#      Other Clinical Notes and Discharge Summary PDFs.
